### get every show
GET http://localhost:3001/shows HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### create one -- the server gives it an id
POST http://localhost:3001/shows HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "a show made from VS Code"
}

### replace one (PUT replaces the WHOLE record)
PUT http://localhost:3001/shows/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "an edited show"
}

### change one field, leave the rest alone
PATCH http://localhost:3001/shows/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### delete one
DELETE http://localhost:3001/shows/1 HTTP/1.1
